# Dependencies of the synthetic fixture generators (prompt 3 section 8 "Fixtures";
# docs/adr/0018-extractor-dependencies-and-sandbox-image.md): the top-level pins.
# The installable file is requirements-fixtures.lock, compiled from this file
# with every transitive dependency pinned and hashed, constrained by the runtime
# lock so that shared dependencies keep one version. The image target "fixtures"
# installs requirements.lock and requirements-fixtures.lock; the extractor
# sandbox (target "extractor") does not carry these.
-c requirements.lock

